  Since I''m the first of my lineage, the Private Memory is going to be a bust. So, the Research Counter it is. That task is going to be the foundation of everything I do from here on out. It''ll define my entire agenda, at least initially. The system''s advice to take things one step at a time is sound; I''ll stick to that.


  So, here''s the immediate plan: head to the Research Counter. Once I have the task details, I can start formulating a hypothesis, a plan of attack, and begin investigating the rooms. I might need to leverage the Public Memory or Archive at some point, once I''ve gained the necessary maturity. But, for now, the path forward is clear. Research Counter, here I come.

