    \nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.704842\nTraining time: 163s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 7bc2f073-72ba-46a7-9c42-8e0a531b4139\nTotal time: 165s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 01:50:10,040\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761069010040710990\n2025-10-22 01:50:10,054\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761069010054607849\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Simple 1D CNN Baseline' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 150.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling\
