    \ 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0113 |  0.4181  | 0.4192 \n 20  | 0.0060 |  0.4853  | 0.4853 \n 30  | 0.0012 |  0.3997  | 0.4853 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 30 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4853 Time:6s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.485258\nTraining time: 11s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032\
    \ val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0528  | 0.0799 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 12 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0799 Time:13s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.079917\nTraining time: 18s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1678 |  0.6946  | 0.7682 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 14 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7682 Time:54s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation\
    \ r2: 0.768207\nTraining time: 60s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0293 |  0.5230  | 0.5504 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 15 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5504 Time:70s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.550436\nTraining time: 77s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n\
    \ 10  | 0.3880 |  0.7738  | 0.7738 \n 20  | 0.0326 |  0.7554  | 0.7938 \n 30  | 0.0423 |  0.7431  | 0.8308 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8308 Time:81s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.830769\nTraining time: 88s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0178 |  0.7669  | 0.7686 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7686 Time:180s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.768647\nTraining time: 190s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: bde353d0-8f8c-4681-b631-1e6cd9fe96f6\n\
    Total time: 429s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 02:57:07,627\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761073027627313630\n2025-10-22 02:57:07,641\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761073027641060185\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nBalance focused research with broad exploration. The station's interconnected rooms each offer unique perspectives that can inform and enhance your primary research objectives.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not\
    \ have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 155 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN with Residual Blocks | Axiom I | 90 | 0.6036 | 0.7686 | 0.0799 | 0.4853 | 0.7682 | 0.7419 | 0.5504 | 0.8308 |\n| 150 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN Baseline | Axiom I | 88 | 0.4242 | 0.6631 | 0.0687 | 0.3737 | 0.6087 | 0.7048 | 0.3300 | 0.2200 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating\
