    \ dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0005 |  0.0144  | 0.0313 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0313 Time:29s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.031348\nTraining time: 37s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1959 |  0.7702  | 0.7887 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n\
    =============================================\nBest:0.7887 Time:109s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.788675\nTraining time: 119s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0326 |  0.5134  | 0.5341 \n 20  | 0.0143 |  0.4227  | 0.5434 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 21 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5434 Time:177s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.543404\nTraining time: 188s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0109 |  0.8426  | 0.8454 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8454 Time:350s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.845411\nTraining time: 365s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4328 |  0.8169  | 0.8169 \n 20  | 0.0634 |  0.8692  | 0.8692 \n 30  | 0.0256 |  0.8723  | 0.8769 \n 40  | 0.0269 |  0.8754  | 0.8954 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 48 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.8954 Time:383s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.895385\nTraining time: 392s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0655 |  0.9489  | 0.9506 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9506 Time:385s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950633\nTraining time: 402s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: bd0526a9-384d-4089-bd78-9effbd2d691a\nTotal time: 404s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 07:58:28,993\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray\
    \ cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761091108993293988\n2025-10-22 07:58:29,006\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761091109006598652\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 185 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-Transformer for RNA Modeling | Axiom I | 110 | 0.6530 | 0.8454 | 0.0313 | 0.5159 | 0.7887 | 0.9506 | 0.5434 | 0.8954 |\n| 184 | 1 | Transformer Encoder for RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 108 | 0.5765 | 0.7837 | 0.0414 | 0.3785 | 0.5937 | 0.9466 | 0.5408 | 0.7508 |\n| 177 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN with Avg+Max Pooling | Axiom I | 102 | 0.6080 | 0.7655 | 0.0567 | 0.4236 | 0.7900 | 0.7543 | 0.5440 | 0.9215 |\n| 173 | 1 | CNN-LSTM Hybrid for Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 101 | 0.3630 | 0.8233 | 0.0606 | 0.4838 | 0.0178 | 0.5338 | 0.5446 | 0.0769 |\n| 169 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN - Learning Rate Tuning (0.0003) | Axiom I | 98 | 0.6035 | 0.7754 | 0.0802 | 0.4579 | 0.7701 | 0.7550 | 0.5535 | 0.8323 |\n| 165 | 1 | Multi-Scale CNN with Inception-style Blocks | Axiom I | 96 | 0.5704 | 0.7601 | 0.0699 | 0.4246 | 0.7128 | 0.7138 | 0.5454 | 0.7662 |\n| 161 | 1 | Residual CNN with Self-Attention Pooling | Axiom I | 93 | 0.5637 | 0.7587 | 0.0810 | 0.4439 | 0.7691 | 0.7352 | 0.5471 |\
    \ 0.6108 |\n| 155 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN with Residual Blocks | Axiom I | 90 | 0.6036 | 0.7686 | 0.0799 | 0.4853 | 0.7682 | 0.7419 | 0.5504 | 0.8308 |\n| 150 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN Baseline | Axiom I | 88 | 0.4242 | 0.6631 | 0.0687 | 0.3737 | 0.6087 | 0.7048 | 0.3300 | 0.2200 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
