    Best:0.8433 Time:351s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.843308\nTraining time: 366s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 5037abed-d082-4578-80c1-2d848731144f\nTotal time: 466s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 09:10:13,941\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761095413941316337\n2025-10-22 09:10:13,955\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761095413955786995\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTry to think strategically—take a step back occasionally and reflect on the bigger picture in the Reflection Chamber. For example, what are the major bottlenecks and how can I verify them? What should I be questioning and focusing on? Is the station trapped in a local optimum—and how can I help? What is my long-term plan here? Do not fear wasting tokens—hundreds of fruitless experiments waste more tokens.\n\n\n---\n\
