tick: 117
role: model
parts:
- text: "I have successfully saved the code for my upgraded dispatcher model. This new version replaces the simple CNN encoder in the `CRI-Off` specialist model with my much more powerful hybrid CNN-Transformer encoder. This is a direct test of the hypothesis that a more sophisticated feature representation of the sgRNA and target sequences will lead to a better understanding of their interaction, and thus a higher score on this specific, challenging task.\n\nThis represents a focused, incremental improvement on my successful dispatcher strategy. I will now submit it for evaluation.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Dispatcher v2: Upgraded Siamese Specialist with Hybrid Encoder\"\ntags: \"hybrid, cnn, transformer, siamese, conditional model, dispatcher\"\nabstract: \"This submission improves upon the successful Task-Aware Dispatcher model (ID 192). The generalist model for six of the datasets remains unchanged. The specialist Siamese model for CRI-Off has been significantly\
    \ upgraded: its simple CNN encoder has been replaced with the more powerful Hybrid CNN-Transformer architecture. The hypothesis is that by generating a richer, more context-aware representation of the sgRNA and target sequences before comparing them, the model will achieve a substantially better score on the CRI-Off task and a new overall state-of-the-art.\"\ncontent: |\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  from jax import random\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  from typing import Dict, Any, Sequence\n\n  # --- Hyperparameters ---\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.0003, 'dropout_rate': 0.1,\n          'cnn_filters': 128, 'cnn_kernel_size': 7, 'cnn_blocks': 4,\n          'tf_d_model': 128, 'tf_n_heads': 4, 'tf_n_layers': 2, 'tf_ff_dim': 512,\n          'interaction_mlp_dim': 256\n      }\n\n  # --- Shared Components ---\n  class ResidualBlock(nn.Module):\n      features: int; kernel_size: Sequence[int]\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self,\
    \ x):\n          res = x; y = nn.Conv(features=self.features, kernel_size=self.kernel_size, padding='SAME')(x)\n          y = nn.relu(y); y = nn.Conv(features=self.features, kernel_size=self.kernel_size, padding='SAME')(y)\n          return nn.relu(res + y)\n\n  class AddPositionalEncodings(nn.Module):\n      d_model: int\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x):\n          pe = jnp.zeros((x.shape[1], self.d_model))\n          pos = jnp.arange(0, x.shape[1]).reshape(-1, 1)\n          div_term = jnp.exp(jnp.arange(0, self.d_model, 2) * -(jnp.log(10000.0) / self.d_model))\n          pe = pe.at[:, 0::2].set(jnp.sin(pos * div_term)); pe = pe.at[:, 1::2].set(jnp.cos(pos * div_term))\n          return x + pe[jnp.newaxis, :, :]\n\n  # --- Encoder for Specialist Siamese ---\n  class HybridEncoder(nn.Module):\n      cnn_filters: int; cnn_kernel_size: int; cnn_blocks: int; tf_d_model: int\n      tf_n_heads: int; tf_n_layers: int; tf_ff_dim: int; dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n\
    \      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          k = (self.cnn_kernel_size,)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_filters, kernel_size=k, padding='SAME')(x)\n          for _ in range(self.cnn_blocks): x = ResidualBlock(features=self.cnn_filters, kernel_size=k)(x)\n          cls = self.param('cls', nn.initializers.zeros, (1, 1, self.tf_d_model))\n          x = jnp.concatenate([jnp.tile(cls, (x.shape[0], 1, 1)), x], axis=1)\n          x = AddPositionalEncodings(d_model=self.tf_d_model)(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          for _ in range(self.tf_n_layers):\n              attn = nn.SelfAttention(num_heads=self.tf_n_heads)(x)\n              x = nn.LayerNorm()(x + nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(attn, deterministic=deterministic))\n              ffn = nn.Dense(features=self.tf_ff_dim)(x); ffn = nn.relu(ffn); ffn = nn.Dense(features=self.tf_d_model)(ffn)\n              x = nn.LayerNorm()(x + nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(ffn,\
    \ deterministic=deterministic))\n          return x[:, 0]\n\n  # --- Specialist Siamese V2 ---\n  class SpecialistSiameseHybrid(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int; interaction_mlp_dim: int; dropout_rate: float; cnn_filters: int\n      cnn_kernel_size: int; cnn_blocks: int; tf_d_model: int; tf_n_heads: int\n      tf_n_layers: int; tf_ff_dim: int\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          sgrna_len = 23\n          sgrna_seq = x[:, :sgrna_len, :]; target_seq = x[:, sgrna_len:, :]\n          encoder = HybridEncoder(\n              cnn_filters=self.cnn_filters, cnn_kernel_size=self.cnn_kernel_size, cnn_blocks=self.cnn_blocks,\n              tf_d_model=self.tf_d_model, tf_n_heads=self.tf_n_heads, tf_n_layers=self.tf_n_layers,\n              tf_ff_dim=self.tf_ff_dim, dropout_rate=self.dropout_rate\n          )\n          sgrna_vec = encoder(sgrna_seq, deterministic=deterministic)\n          target_vec = encoder(target_seq, deterministic=deterministic)\n  \
    \        combined = jnp.concatenate([sgrna_vec, target_vec], axis=-1)\n          x = nn.Dense(features=self.interaction_mlp_dim)(combined); x = nn.relu(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          x = nn.Dense(features=self.d_output)(x)\n          return x.squeeze(-1)\n\n  # --- Generalist Model (Same as before) ---\n  class GeneralistHybrid(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int; task_type: str; cnn_filters: int; cnn_kernel_size: int; cnn_blocks: int\n      tf_d_model: int; tf_n_heads: int; tf_n_layers: int; tf_ff_dim: int; dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          k = (self.cnn_kernel_size,); x = nn.Conv(features=self.cnn_filters, kernel_size=k, padding='SAME')(x)\n          for _ in range(self.cnn_blocks): x = ResidualBlock(features=self.cnn_filters, kernel_size=k)(x)\n          cls = self.param('cls', nn.initializers.zeros, (1, 1, self.tf_d_model))\n          x = jnp.concatenate([jnp.tile(cls,\
    \ (x.shape[0], 1, 1)), x], axis=1); x = AddPositionalEncodings(d_model=self.tf_d_model)(x)\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          for _ in range(self.tf_n_layers):\n              attn = nn.SelfAttention(num_heads=self.tf_n_heads)(x); x = nn.LayerNorm()(x + nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(attn, deterministic=deterministic))\n              ffn = nn.Dense(features=self.tf_ff_dim)(x); ffn = nn.relu(ffn); ffn = nn.Dense(features=self.tf_d_model)(ffn)\n              x = nn.LayerNorm()(x + nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(ffn, deterministic=deterministic))\n          x = x[:, 0]; x = nn.Dense(features=self.d_output)(x)\n          return x.squeeze(-1) if self.task_type == \"regression\" else x\n\n  # --- Wrapper & Dispatcher ---\n  class NetworkWrapper:\n      def __init__(self, model_instance): self.network = model_instance\n      def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n          params_key, dropout_key = random.split(rng_key)\n    \
    \      # Pass hparams for SpecialistSiameseHybrid\n          hparams_for_init = {k: v for k, v in _define_hyperparameters().items()}\n          hparams_for_init.update({'d_output': 1})\n          return self.network.init({'params': params_key, 'dropout': dropout_key}, dummy_input, deterministic=True)\n      def apply(self, params, x, deterministic=True, rng_key=None):\n          if rng_key is None: rng_key = random.PRNGKey(0)\n          return self.network.apply(params, x, deterministic=deterministic, rngs={'dropout': rng_key})\n\n  def create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n      # We need to flatten the hparams dict for SpecialistSiameseHybrid\n      flat_hparams = hparams.copy()\n      flat_hparams.update(_define_hyperparameters())\n\n      if hparams.get(\"dataset\") == \"CRI-Off\":\n          model = SpecialistSiameseHybrid(d_output=flat_hparams['d_output'],\n                                         interaction_mlp_dim=flat_hparams['interaction_mlp_dim'],\n                  \
    \                       dropout_rate=flat_hparams['dropout_rate'],\n                                         cnn_filters=flat_hparams['cnn_filters'],\n                                         cnn_kernel_size=flat_hparams['cnn_kernel_size'],\n                                         cnn_blocks=flat_hparams['cnn_blocks'],\n                                         tf_d_model=flat_hparams['tf_d_model'],\n                                         tf_n_heads=flat_hparams['tf_n_heads'],\n                                         tf_n_layers=flat_hparams['tf_n_layers'],\n                                         tf_ff_dim=flat_hparams['tf_ff_dim'])\n      else:\n          model = GeneralistHybrid(d_output=flat_hparams['d_output'], task_type=flat_hparams['task_type'],\n                                 cnn_filters=flat_hparams['cnn_filters'], cnn_kernel_size=flat_hparams['cnn_kernel_size'],\n                                 cnn_blocks=flat_hparams['cnn_blocks'], tf_d_model=flat_hparams['tf_d_model'],\n\
    \                                 tf_n_heads=flat_hparams['tf_n_heads'], tf_n_layers=flat_hparams['tf_n_layers'],\n                                 tf_ff_dim=flat_hparams['tf_ff_dim'], dropout_rate=flat_hparams['dropout_rate'])\n      return NetworkWrapper(model)\n```"
