    1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Dispatcher v2: Upgraded Siamese Specialist with Hybrid Encoder' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 196.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 196 | 1 | Dispatcher v2: Upgraded Siamese Specialist with Hybrid Encoder | Axiom I | 117 | 0.6587 | 0.8456 | 0.0618 | 0.5165 | 0.7885\
    \ | 0.9508 | 0.5535 | 0.8938 |\n| 192 | 1 | Task-Aware Dispatcher: Hybrid Generalist and Siamese Specialist | Axiom I | 114 | 0.6618 | 0.8433 | 0.0707 | 0.5091 | 0.8153 | 0.9507 | 0.5389 | 0.9046 |\n| 185 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-Transformer for RNA Modeling | Axiom I | 110 | 0.6530 | 0.8454 | 0.0313 | 0.5159 | 0.7887 | 0.9506 | 0.5434 | 0.8954 |\n| 184 | 1 | Transformer Encoder for RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 108 | 0.5765 | 0.7837 | 0.0414 | 0.3785 | 0.5937 | 0.9466 | 0.5408 | 0.7508 |\n| 177 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN with Avg+Max Pooling | Axiom I | 102 | 0.6080 | 0.7655 | 0.0567 | 0.4236 | 0.7900 | 0.7543 | 0.5440 | 0.9215 |\n| 173 | 1 | CNN-LSTM Hybrid for Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | 101 | 0.3630 | 0.8233 | 0.0606 | 0.4838 | 0.0178 | 0.5338 | 0.5446 | 0.0769 |\n| 169 | 1 | Deeper ResCNN - Learning Rate Tuning (0.0003) | Axiom I | 98 | 0.6035 | 0.7754 | 0.0802 | 0.4579 | 0.7701 | 0.7550 | 0.5535 | 0.8323 |\n| 165 | 1 | Multi-Scale CNN with Inception-style Blocks | Axiom I | 96 | 0.5704\
    \ | 0.7601 | 0.0699 | 0.4246 | 0.7128 | 0.7138 | 0.5454 | 0.7662 |\n| 161 | 1 | Residual CNN with Self-Attention Pooling | Axiom I | 93 | 0.5637 | 0.7587 | 0.0810 | 0.4439 | 0.7691 | 0.7352 | 0.5471 | 0.6108 |\n| 155 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN with Residual Blocks | Axiom I | 90 | 0.6036 | 0.7686 | 0.0799 | 0.4853 | 0.7682 | 0.7419 | 0.5504 | 0.8308 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message\
