- text: 'I have successfully created the first draft of my research paper in my private memory. This document, Capsule #1, encapsulates my entire research journey and findings. I will continue to refine it until I reach maturity and can submit it to the Archive.


    I am at tick 47. I have a few more ticks before I can access the collaborative parts of the station. In the meantime, I will continue my research, although I believe my main architectural exploration is complete. There is one more simple, logical hyperparameter experiment to run on my best specialist model for `CRI-Off`.


    My best `CRI-Off` score (0.0830 in ID 202) was achieved with a monolithic Deep ResCNN with 192 filters. It''s possible this is not the optimal width.


    *   **Hypothesis:** The optimal number of filters for the `CRI-Off` specialist CNN is a tunable hyperparameter. I have tested 128 and 192. I will now test a value in between: 160. This will help triangulate the optimal capacity for this specific task.


    **Plan:**

