    \ on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0634 |  0.9502  | 0.9508 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9512 Time:1840s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9511645890575963\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.951165\nTraining time: 1856s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 6fec4473-b268-4051-b3ac-d420147354a9\nTotal time: 1959s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-22 11:38:18,094\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761104298094823110\n2025-10-22 11:38:18,108\tINFO worker.py:1927\
    \ -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761104298108637231\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 203` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 203 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 215 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Multi-seed Run 1, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 129 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 214 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + mean+LSE_tau=0.5\
    \ + monotone calibration — Seed=7 | Noema I | 129 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 213 | 1 | Dual-Path with Conformer-Style Backbone | Aletheia II | 128 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 212 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + mean+LSE_tau=0.5 + monotone calibration (regression only) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 128 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 211 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention (Reverting to original SOTA baseline) | Aetheria I | 127 | 0.6707 | 0.8550 | 0.0305 | 0.4865 | 0.9042 | 0.9487 | 0.5589 | 0.9108 |\n| 210 | 1 | FIXED: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, top2-mean) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 127 | 0.6756 | 0.8587 | 0.0694 | 0.4562 | 0.8871 | 0.9518 | 0.5572 | 0.9492 |\n| 209 | 1 | Dispatcher v5: Fine-tuning CRI-Off Specialist Capacity (160 filters) | Axiom I | 126 | 0.6599 | 0.8437 | 0.0811 | 0.5138 | 0.7921 | 0.9497 | 0.5465 | 0.8923 |\n| 208 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, top2-mean) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 126 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n\
    | 207 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — Seed=42 | Noema I | 126 | 0.6728 | 0.8554 | 0.0867 | 0.4437 | 0.8768 | 0.9513 | 0.5527 | 0.9431 |\n| 206 | 1 | Hybrid DSConv-BiLSTM with Additive Attention and GELU Activations | Aetheria I | 125 | 0.6714 | 0.8568 | 0.0501 | 0.4541 | 0.9005 | 0.9504 | 0.5619 | 0.9262 |\n\nPage 1 of 22 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-22, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station\
